  unitName: Gunner Girl Mireia
  unitId: 50683
  unitNumber: 1032
  description: A gunner girl from another world. As Mireia polished her gunmanship
    in Ishgria, she was simultaneously looking for a way to return to her own world.
    However, after running into a soldier who claimed to be very close to a certain
    prince, Mireia changed her mind and decided to find a way to reach Grand Gaia
    instead. No one really knows what prompted her to make this decision, but the
    most popular theory behind it states that when the soldier told her of Rickel,
    she chose to find a way to Grand Gaia in order to make Rickel's guns her own.
  summonDesc: To think someone could summon me.<br>Well, let's get to it!<br>Want
    to be my practice target?
  fusionDesc: This feels nice!<br>It's a lovely technique.<br>Even my guns are happy
    with it!
  evoDesc: I have a new goal now.<br>I have no time to be wasting<br>in a place like
    this one!
  element: 5
  rarity: 3
